    "project": "research/rho_twochoice_collision_audit_20261115/lean",
    "theorem": "RhoTwoChoiceCollisionAudit.twochoice_collision_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem twochoice_collision_certificate : (∀ (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime], ensembleMean p = ∑ f : Fin 2 ↪ ZMod p, (uniformLaw (Fin 2 ↪ ZMod p) f).toReal * ∑ h : Hash (ZMod p) (Fin 2), (hashLaw fair fair_nonneg fair_sum h).toReal * (firstCollision p (fun x => x + f (h x)) 0 : ℝ)) ∧ (∀ (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (m : ℕ), 0 < m → 4 * m^2 * (4 * m + 1) ≤ p → (m : ℝ)^2 / 2 ≤ ensembleMean p) ∧ (∀ C : ℕ, ∃ p : ℕ, ∃ hp : p.Prime, (C : ℝ) * p < (@ensembleMean p ⟨hp⟩)^2) ∧ (¬∃ K : ℝ, 0 ≤ K ∧ ∀ p : ℕ, ∀ hp : p.Prime, @ensembleMean p ⟨hp⟩ ≤ K * Real.sqrt p) ∧ (∀ W n : ℕ, ∀ s : ℤ, (W : ℝ)^2 * hitMass W n s ≤ (s : ℝ)^2 + n) ∧ (hitMass 1 1 0 = 1 ∧ hitMass 2 1 0 = 0) ∧ ((∀ i : Fin 2, 0 < fair i) ∧ (∑ i : Fin 2, fair i) = 1 ∧ (∑ i : Fin 2, (fair i)^2) = 1 / 2) ∧ (∀ (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (d : ℕ), 0 < d → d < p → ∀ k : ZMod p, finiteMean (fun z : TwoSupport p => if (d : ZMod p) * z.1 + k * z.2.val = 0 then (1 : ℝ) else 0) = 1 / p) ∧ (¬∀ w : Fin 3 → Fin 2, expectation controlWeights (fun h : Hash (ZMod 3) (Fin 2) => if observations controlUpdate h 0 3 = w then (1 : ℝ) else 0) = weight controlWeights w)",
    "decl_sha256": "ce864beb518e06e523e89e965cc96ef0d00e05836cae76e1e4d229659cb0d339",
    "scope": "Actual uniform ordered distinct two-increment support on each prime Z/p, individual zero increments allowed/equal increments excluded; independent actual fair static binary vertex hash, actual least repeat from0. Genuine finite uniform-support PMF and vertex-product PMF meanE defined and identified, firstpoint/nonzero difference bijection derived. Actual iid-word prefix stopped-square bound W²hitMass≤s²+n; goodword mass≥3/4 at time m²,boundary2m. Actual chronological integer/Zp paths and balanced collision relation derived; at most m²(4m+1) shortrelations. Each actual distinct-support relation0<d<p has mass1/p, d0/k0 guardmass1. Actual static-hash/iid selfavoidance bridge credited and reused only for survival, not unrestricted postcollision words. Ensemble survival≥1/2 and E≥m²/2 whenever p≥4m²(4m+1). Bertrand yields for every naturalC a primep with E²>Cp, and no realnonnegative K bounds E≤Ksqrtp for allprimes. Actual one-step hit controls1/0, fairpositive normalized/I2=1/2, credited actual primeZ3 postcollision word static0vs iid1/8. This is r2 negativecalibration of unqualified square-root extension, not refutation of qualified nS≥8/20 large-partition source conjectures. Existing qualified Hildebrand random-support mixing/fixed20Sidon/staticfirstcollision methods credited; established maximal/unioncount/Bertrand/deferred-decisions methods/no novelty. Firstrepeat not Floydoperations/cyclealone/scalarrecovery/practicalhashruntime. Sevennewmodules6concrete1adapter/10frozen localmodules0copies/22oldformalconfigs/36oldformal-artifactpins checked every13states/twogates. Full written header explicitly gives primeFact arguments after first frozen parser prefix diagnostic; verifier unchanged. Foundations/defaults only/noholes/customaxioms/nativeproofeval/raisedlimits/globalflags/waivers/frozenedits/cryptoPython/newsolverbenchmark/spend/upload/newhost/compilerrefinement/canonicalpromotion/full14claim. Larger-partition collision penalty/constants and other14 obligations remainopen.",
